schmeckts-server (1.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New /api/photo: the server keeps the large packaging photo of each
    variety, the first one a phone sends, and hands it to the other
    phones, so every phone in the household can open it. Photos of
    varieties that are gone are removed within the hour.

 -- Schmeckts <schmeckts@localhost>  Mon, 28 Sep 2026 20:00:00 +0200

schmeckts-server (1.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New /api/fed: whether a meal has been served since a given time. The
    phones ask it before a feeding reminder, so nobody is reminded of a
    meal someone else has already served.
  * The overview names the new rating level "Erst gierig".

 -- Schmeckts <schmeckts@localhost>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 20:00:00 +0200

schmeckts-server (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Barcode lookup through Open Pet Food Facts and Open Food Facts,
    with a cache.
  * New "overview" command and an „Übersicht“ button in the setup window.
  * Setup window with clear buttons, address and code first.
  * Package description without umlauts, plus AppStream metadata.

 -- Schmeckts <schmeckts@localhost>  Sat, 19 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0200

schmeckts-server (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

